# Juniper Lane Tea: Email Program Review, Q3 2026

Prepared 2026-10-01. Source: email platform export and GA4. All revenue figures are GA4 revenue from email sessions.

## Summary

- 14 sends in Q3 earned **€35,065** in revenue.
- **Best campaign of the quarter: Clearance blast**, with 1,343 clicks, the most of any send. We recommend making the clearance blast a monthly send from October.
- The list is healthy: engagement was stable all quarter (click-to-open rate by month: 2026-07 9.0%, 2026-08 11.0%, 2026-09 9.9%).

